;;; RunDonut.mon --- Render the spinning donut in a terminal

:author "Laluxx"
:version "1.0.0"
:keywords "cli terminal graphics donut example"

;;; Commentary:

 This executable entry point keeps Donut importable and testable without side
 effects. Compile and run this file to draw one frame in an 80-column terminal;
 Donut.mon remains the reusable renderer and animation API.

;;; Code:

import Donut

module RunDonut []


spin-frames 0.0 0.0 1
